            "review_title": "Review at Olive Snacks And Drinks",
            "review_text": "Zoe Crompton\nManchester, United Kingdom99 contributions\n0\nBelow average food and overcharged\nApr 2024 • Friends\nWe ordered some food and waited a while for our drinks order to be taken.. the staff seemed more interested in getting more people into the bar than getting us sorted.\nI ordered some prawns 🍤 which came fully clothed and just dunked in batter which I couldn’t eat and were not as advertised. I politely said I couldn’t eat them like that, I was willing to pay for them anyway - they added them to the bill but over charged for them… adding 30%.\nThe food was greasy and not great when it arrived and the noodles were like cheap super noodles ..there are far better places in the area! We paid around £40 for 4 people for below average food and awful service.\n\nDon’t Recommend at all …\nRead more\nWritten April 23, 2024",
